sequenceDiagram
    %% WebSocket Frame Prediction Flow
    %% Converted from PlantUML sequence_frame_flow.puml
    title WebSocket Frame Prediction Flow

    actor User as User
    participant FE as React SPA<br>(FaceWsDemo)
    participant Camera as Webcam API<br>(getUserMedia)
    participant WS as WebSocket Client<br>(useFaceWebSocket)
    participant BE as FastAPI Server<br>(Backend)
    participant Haar as Haar Cascade<br>Detector
    participant Model as Keras<br>EfficientNet

    Note over User,Model: Initialization

    User->>FE: Opens page
    FE->>Camera: getUserMedia({ video: true })
    Camera-->>FE: MediaStream
    FE->>FE: Attach stream to <video> element<br>and start playback

    FE->>WS: new WebSocket("ws://localhost:8000/ws/predict")
    WS->>BE: WebSocket connection request
    BE-->>WS: WebSocket accept

    Note over WS,BE: Binary protocol

    WS->>BE: send JSON text: { client, format, width, height }
    BE-->>WS: send JSON: { type: "ready", message, config }

    Note over User,Model: Frame Capture & Prediction Loop

    loop Every 300ms (or on demand)
        FE->>FE: Draw <video> frame onto <canvas>
        FE->>FE: canvas.toBlob("image/jpeg", 0.8)
        FE->>WS: send binary (JPEG blob)
        WS->>BE: receive_bytes() → decode JPEG → np.ndarray
        BE->>Haar: detectMultiScale(gray_frame)
        Haar-->>BE: List of face bounding boxes [x,y,w,h]

        loop For each detected face
            BE->>BE: crop face region from frame
            BE->>BE: convert to RGB, resize to (224,224), normalize
            BE->>Model: model.predict(face_tensor)
            Model-->>BE: softmax scores
            BE->>BE: argmax → predicted_class, max → confidence
        end

        BE-->>WS: send JSON: { type: "prediction", faces_detected, predictions }
        WS->>FE: ws.onmessage → parse JSON
        FE->>FE: setFaces(predictions) → re-render UI
    end

    Note over User,Model: Termination

    User->>FE: Leaves page
    FE->>WS: disconnectSocket()
    WS->>BE: WebSocket close
    FE->>Camera: stopCamera() → release MediaStream tracks